# Force LF line endings on text files so Windows checkouts don't
# reintroduce CRLF and trip biome's formatter on CI. Without this,
# git's `core.autocrlf` setting can swap LF → CRLF in the working
# tree on Windows; the file ends up CRLF on disk but committed as LF
# (or vice-versa), which works fine until biome runs and rejects the
# format mismatch.
*               text=auto eol=lf

# Binary blobs we never want munged (defensive — biome ignores
# binaries already, but git's autocrlf shouldn't touch them either).
*.png           binary
*.jpg           binary
*.jpeg          binary
*.gif           binary
*.ico           binary
*.wav           binary
*.mp3           binary
*.ttf           binary
*.otf           binary
*.zip           binary
